OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOften cloudy today with
OL,6,Foccasional sunny intervals, especially
OL,7,Fin the south. There will also be a
OL,8,Fchance of showers, mainly in the north
OL,9,Fand west of the region. Feeling
OL,10,Fnotably cooler with a brisk westerly
OL,11,Fbreeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA windy evening to come with
OL,14,Fsome further outbreaks of rain. Winds
OL,15,Fwill slowly ease overnight but one or
OL,16,Ftwo showers will continue to move
OL,17,Facross the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
