OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA rather grey start with
OL,6,Fsome rain perhaps moving southwards
OL,7,Falong the North Sea coast. However it
OL,8,Fwill turn brighter throughout the day
OL,9,Fwith some spells of sunshine
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,13,Fdry with sunny spells on Friday and
OL,14,FSaturday. In the sunshine it will be
OL,15,Ffeeling increasingly warmer, before a
OL,16,Frisk of some showery rain returns on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
